Z||000000||Toddster||07-12-2001||02:38 PM||||Out of the blue I got this bizzare email this morning. It does not specify who he is on the forum, what thread he is talking about, what post I wrote that was SO offensive, or why he has enough spare time on his hands to spew his venom on me personally instead of at the topic I may or may not have been discussing.<P>I wrote him back politely asking him what he was talking about. No answer.<P>Does anyone know this clown?<P><B>Dear Hostile Engineer,<P>I saw your post in Pennock's.  It seems like you are pretty proud of your<BR>engineering degree.  Why?<P>Is your degree in fashion, floral, or custodial engineering?  Did you earn<BR>it by mail?<P>Those questions pissed you off didn't they?  You are now angry because I<BR>don't know you and I have not shown you the respect you desire.  I made<BR>assumptions about you and your character that are based on inadequate<BR>evidence, just one inappropriate post on the Fiero Forum.<P>Hey, at least I didn't put this message on Pennock's!  This courtesy was<BR>more than you seem to be willing to offer others.<P>How do you justify what appears to be a personal attack and deliberate<BR>slander of another member?  Did it make your little ego feel nourished?  It<BR>made me think you are an arrogant ass.<P>Please learn to show other members respect or don't post at all.<P>Also, consider learning to how to spell the word "advice".  Most degreed<BR>professionals can spell at the third grade level or better.  What is your<BR>excuse?</B><P>||||reg||1
