Z||000027||Toddster||07-15-2001||01:44 PM||||I find it so amazing that whenever I catch someone making a ridiculous point that they feel this pitiful need to turn it around on me. <P>I'll make this simple Bam-Bam, This is GENERAL FIERO CHAT. Read this with me, G-E-N-E-R-A-L F-I-E-R-O C-H-A-T.<P>If you don't like the topic, don't read it.<P>I posted this to find-out who this guy was so I could respond to his email. I've done so. As far as i'm concerned the thread is dead.<P>If you want to keep it going under a NEW topic of what is, and what is not, worthy of being posted here then fine, I'll be happy to debate that issue. <P>But keep personalities out of it. I have NEVER slammed anyone here and I get a little sick and tired of being told that I do, despite the fact that you can't show one post where I call anyone names like the ones you just called me. AND despite my EXTREME demonstrations of self-control in the face of such pissy posts like your last one.<P>NOW, do you want to debate the merits of what constitutes GENERAL FIERO CHAT, do you want to drop the subject all together, or do you want to keep throwing temper tantrums?||||reg||1
